# The build context is the repository, and most of the repository is not an input to an image.
# Above all: build output and node_modules from the host. A host's node_modules copied over the
# container's own `npm ci` replaces Linux binaries with macOS ones, and the web build fails in ways
# that look nothing like the cause.
**/target
**/node_modules
till-web/dist
till-web/coverage
till-web/playwright-report
till-web/test-results
.git
.github
.idea
.vscode
